      "category": "offensive",
      "cost": "1",
      "description": "<p>The fence [[/act feint]]{Feints}, then can Step. If the feint succeeds, the target is Off-Guard against the fence's melee attacks until the end of the fence's next turn (or to all melee attacks on a critical success).</p>",
