      "cost": "passive",
      "description": "<p>Fences can use @Check[underworld-lore|traits:action:identify-magic] to identify an item's value and Identify Magic on an item. They gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Underworld Lore checks when doing so, and to all Underworld Lore checks related to stolen items.</p>",
